"Choose a folder with your photos and Piklin will organize them.\n"
"\n"
"Your photos are never moved or changed. Edits are saved separately, so your originals stay exactly as they are."
msgstr ""
"Elige una carpeta con tus fotos y Piklin las organizará.\n"
"\n"
"Tus fotos nunca se mueven ni se modifican. Los cambios se guardan aparte, así que tus originales se quedan tal cual."

